flowchart TB
    Tabs[Profile-aware tabs] --> Save[TabRestorationManager saves URL, title, profile, privacy, order, active tab]
    Save --> Restart[PHNX restarts]
    Restart --> LoadProfiles[Load profiles]
    LoadProfiles --> LoadTabs[Load saved tabs]
    LoadTabs --> Policy[Phase 5 resource policy selects required sessions]
    Policy --> Restore[Restore selected sessions]
    Restore --> Active[Resume active profile and tabs]
    Private[Private tabs] -. do not persist as normal tabs .-> Restore

